### 1. Get all postings
GET http://localhost:8080/postings

### 2. Get non-existent posting
GET http://localhost:8080/postings/999

### 3. Create posting
### Price is calculated by the service.
POST http://localhost:8080/postings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Alice",
  "to": "Bob",
  "content": "Books",
  "deliveryType": "Courier",
  "weight": 2.5,
  "width": 30,
  "height": 20,
  "depth": 10,
  "value": 50
}

### 4. Get created posting
GET http://localhost:8080/postings/1

### 5. Update posting
PUT http://localhost:8080/postings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "from": "Alice Updated",
  "to": "Bob Updated",
  "content": "Updated Books",
  "deliveryType": "ExpressCourier",
  "weight": 3,
  "width": 35,
  "height": 25,
  "depth": 15,
  "value": 75,
  "price": 100
}

### 6. Get updated posting
GET http://localhost:8080/postings/1

### 7. Delete posting
DELETE http://localhost:8080/postings/1

### 8. Verify deletion
GET http://localhost:8080/postings/1